From f19e4d643efba0105e7d58ff6dc8bc1caed1db4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 28 Mar 2024 00:52:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] neoverse-rd/rdn2 add pcie mmap sds region

UEFI configures and pass the memory map region info to the OS thru
ACPI tables. Currently, this is hardcoded in the table.

The memory map region info calculated at SCP is passed to UEFI via
ARM-TF. To achieve this SCP should program it in the SDS which is then
conusmed by ARM-TF to produce device tree. This device tree blob is then
passed to UEFI.

Add SDS region to pass PCIe MMAP data.

Signed-off-by: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Change-Id: Ib912c744c0bffd45ad775225c124400eb0dd635e

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
